OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm not sure who I am' - Bake Off
OL,4,Awinner in shock after bipolar diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former winner of the Great British
OL,7,FBake Off has said "I'm not sure who I
OL,8,Fam right now" after being diagnosed
OL,9,Fwith bipolar disorder.
OL,11,FGeorgina Grasso, from Carmarthenshire,
OL,12,Fspoke about having attention deficit
OL,13,Fhyperactivity disorder (ADHD) during
OL,14,Fher time on the show, and said the
OL,15,Freaction from the public had been
OL,16,F"incredible".
OL,18,FBut a new diagnosis has revealed that
OL,19,Fshe has bipolar 2 and autism instead of
OL,20,FADHD, which she said has "come as a
OL,21,Fshock".
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
